\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Looking upward every day,
\par Sunshine on our faces;
\par Pressing onward every day
\par Toward the heavenly places.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Growing every day in awe,
\par For Thy name is holy;
\par Learning every day to love
\par With a love more lowly.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Walking every day more close
\par To our elder Brother;
\par Growing every day more true
\par Unto one another.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Every day more greatfully
\par Kindnesses receiving,
\par Every day more readily
\par Injuries forgiving.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Lord, so we pray every day,
\par Hear us in Thy pity,
\par That we enter in at last
\par To the holy City.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

